    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thruster</strong> is a precision based rocket control game where every move counts. <br>Pilot your rocket through tight spaces, deadly traps, and physics-based challenges. There\u2019s no health bar one wrong move and you're toast. It\u2019s all about precision, timing, and smart fuel management.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Current Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Flight</strong> \u2014 Control your rocket using thrusters to move, hover, and boost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716480/extras/eb05a5e8aa04adea1607d2d0dcb72351.poster.avif?t=1749803834\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716480/extras/eb05a5e8aa04adea1607d2d0dcb72351.webm?t=1749803834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716480/extras/eb05a5e8aa04adea1607d2d0dcb72351.mp4?t=1749803834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716480/extras/b7163afb305648849321ee338b4d55f9.poster.avif?t=1749803834\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716480/extras/b7163afb305648849321ee338b4d55f9.webm?t=1749803834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716480/extras/b7163afb305648849321ee338b4d55f9.mp4?t=1749803834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716480/extras/411cad5dc644451d1e78cba385a1836d.poster.avif?t=1749803834\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716480/extras/411cad5dc644451d1e78cba385a1836d.webm?t=1749803834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716480/extras/411cad5dc644451d1e78cba385a1836d.mp4?t=1749803834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fuel System</strong> \u2014 Limited fuel keeps the pressure on. Fly near a Fuel-Station to Refill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716480/extras/9619a353e4cfd71d054f32f93fadd900.poster.avif?t=1749803834\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716480/extras/9619a353e4cfd71d054f32f93fadd900.webm?t=1749803834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716480/extras/9619a353e4cfd71d054f32f93fadd900.mp4?t=1749803834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test Levels</strong> \u2014 5 early levels built for testing mechanics and gathering feedback. <i>(These are planned for the playtest and will appear in early screenshots, but won\u2019t be part of the final release, will be updated over time.)</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanded Traps</strong> \u2014 More variety like shifting walls, floating objects, and dynamic obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30+ Levels on Full Release</strong> \u2014 A full set of challenging maps with refined gameplay and visuals.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thruster</strong> is a solo-developed project, it's currently in development and will be <strong>free to play</strong> on release. Everything from visuals to mechanics is a work in progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for checking it out. It means a lot!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thruster</strong> is a precision based rocket control game where every move counts. <br>Pilot your rocket through tight spaces, deadly traps, and physics-based challenges. There\u2019s no health bar one wrong move and you're toast. It\u2019s all about precision, timing, and smart fuel management.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Current Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Flight</strong> \u2014 Control your rocket using thrusters to move, hover, and boost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716480/extras/eb05a5e8aa04adea1607d2d0dcb72351.poster.avif?t=1749803834\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716480/extras/eb05a5e8aa04adea1607d2d0dcb72351.webm?t=1749803834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716480/extras/eb05a5e8aa04adea1607d2d0dcb72351.mp4?t=1749803834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716480/extras/b7163afb305648849321ee338b4d55f9.poster.avif?t=1749803834\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716480/extras/b7163afb305648849321ee338b4d55f9.webm?t=1749803834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716480/extras/b7163afb305648849321ee338b4d55f9.mp4?t=1749803834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716480/extras/411cad5dc644451d1e78cba385a1836d.poster.avif?t=1749803834\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716480/extras/411cad5dc644451d1e78cba385a1836d.webm?t=1749803834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716480/extras/411cad5dc644451d1e78cba385a1836d.mp4?t=1749803834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fuel System</strong> \u2014 Limited fuel keeps the pressure on. Fly near a Fuel-Station to Refill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716480/extras/9619a353e4cfd71d054f32f93fadd900.poster.avif?t=1749803834\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716480/extras/9619a353e4cfd71d054f32f93fadd900.webm?t=1749803834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716480/extras/9619a353e4cfd71d054f32f93fadd900.mp4?t=1749803834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test Levels</strong> \u2014 5 early levels built for testing mechanics and gathering feedback. <i>(These are planned for the playtest and will appear in early screenshots, but won\u2019t be part of the final release, will be updated over time.)</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanded Traps</strong> \u2014 More variety like shifting walls, floating objects, and dynamic obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30+ Levels on Full Release</strong> \u2014 A full set of challenging maps with refined gameplay and visuals.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thruster</strong> is a solo-developed project, it's currently in development and will be <strong>free to play</strong> on release. Everything from visuals to mechanics is a work in progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for checking it out. It means a lot!</p>",
